message: "If you use or reference this project, please cite it as below."

title: "VCNIA: Value-Circulating Network Intelligence Architecture"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-04-27"

authors:
  - name: "Shidenkai Alpha"

abstract: >
  VCNIA, or Value-Circulating Network Intelligence Architecture, is a
  conceptual architecture for network intelligence based on value circulation.
  It structures Existence Proof, Gratitude, Trust, and Royalty / Value Allocation
  as a four-layer OS stack for human-AI and AI-to-AI value circulation.

keywords:
